          "title": "Ani-Mayhem",
          "subtitle": "Vying",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ani-Mayhem is an anime-themed commercial trading card game where players build decks from licensed characters, locations, and effects."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Ani-Mayhem was released as a licensed trading card game using multiple anime properties and collectible deck construction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Two players bring constructed decks from the legal card pool."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Use commercial Ani-Mayhem cards and any format deck-building limits."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Anime-themed trading card decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Shuffle decks, draw opening hands, and set up starting areas according to the rules."
            }
          ]
